# What Cloudflare publishes from this repository: only what a city's page needs. Everything is
# left out first, then each kind of file a page uses is let back in. A new kind of file in a
# city's folder (say, a second image folder) stays unpublished until it is named here.
*
!*/
!/index.html
!/*/index.html
!/*/og.png
!/*/venues.json
!/*/img/
!/*/img/card/
!/*/img/card/*.webp
